<p>This lecture title says ArrayList Part-4, but the session also covers:</p>
<ol><li>Collection-wide rules (Serializable, Cloneable, RandomAccess)</li></ol>
<ol><li>ArrayList performance characteristics and vs Vector</li></ol>
